msgstr "Mam to na rękach!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.1"
