#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.2"
