msgstr "Twardy orzech do zgryzienia."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.ANNOUNCE_PUGALISK_INVULNERABLE.3"
