msgstr "Wiatr nie ma szans!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOUREDBOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.ARMOUREDBOAT"
