#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED"
