#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_BROKEN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.GENERIC.DESCRIBE.VOLCANO_ALTAR_BROKEN"
