#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAIR_FOOTREST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_CHAIR_FOOTREST"
