#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_LAMP_ADJUSTABLE"
