#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_RUINS_ENDSWELL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.DECO_RUINS_ENDSWELL"
