#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_MARBLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAGSTAFF.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_FLOOR_MARBLE"
