msgstr "Popłynę z wiatrem."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.BURNING"
