msgstr "Będzie duże bum!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WALANI.DESCRIBE.COCONADE.GENERIC"
