msgstr "Aaach. Koi ból."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.COLD"
