msgstr "Kamień. I tyle."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HEATROCK.HOT"
