msgstr "Sycący posiłek."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HONEYNUGGETS"
