msgstr "Rzekłbym, że to potworny kundel!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.HOUNDBONE"
