#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_UPHOLSTERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.INTERIOR_WALL_UPHOLSTERED"
