msgstr "Prosta ściana."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.INVENTORYGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.INVENTORYGRAVE"
