msgstr "Trzeba to zasadzić."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SEEDS_COOKED"
