msgstr "Ciekawe, dokąd prowadzi."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARBUCKS.DESCRIBE.SHIPWRECKED_EXIT"
