msgstr "Szkoda, że to nie winogrona..."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
