msgstr "Nie mam nic do ciebie!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SNAKE_POISON"
