#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_2"
