msgstr "Co to w ogóle jest?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WARLY.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_5"
