msgstr "Pali się!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.HEDGE.BURNT"
