msgstr "Mam dlań zastosowań bez liku!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_METAL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WATHGRITHR.DESCRIBE.SHELVES_METAL"
msgid "Things may be put on thee!"
