msgstr "Psik, szkodniku."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIKO.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WAXWELL.DESCRIBE.PIKO.SLEEPING"
