#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_PALACE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.PIG_GUARD_TOWER_PALACE.GENERIC"
