msgstr "Lubimy go czuć pod stopami."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SANDBAG"
