msgstr "Smakuje jak kurczak."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEDEN.BURNT"
