msgstr "Całkiem ładny krzaczek."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WEBBER.DESCRIBE.SNAKEOIL"
