msgstr "Niedbale oheblowane deski."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.BOAT"
