msgstr "Nieco chlorku sodu, aby zwabić dzikie bestie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAND
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SAND"
