#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT.ABANDONED"
