#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SUNKEN_BOAT_TRINKET_3"
