msgstr "Posiłek idealny."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEATERVEST"
