msgstr "Całkiem pyszne."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.SWEET_POTATO"
