#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WALL_LIMESTONE_ITEM"
