msgstr "W kieszeni będzie mu wygodnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WALL_PIG_RUINS"
