msgstr "Można z nich wyhodować lanatusa."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WATERYGRAVE"
