#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WICKERBOTTOM.DESCRIBE.WEEVOLE_CARAPACE"
