msgstr "Ha, ha. Już mnie nie dostaniecie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_SPEAR_TRAP_TRIGGERED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_RUINS_SPEAR_TRAP_TRIGGERED"
