#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ACADEMY.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ACADEMY.GENERIC"
