#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ARCANE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_ARCANE.GENERIC"
