#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_BANK.GENERIC"
