#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP.BURNING"
