msgstr "Co za pożar!"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HOOFSPA.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HOOFSPA.GENERIC"
