msgstr "Na wszystkie moje rany i siniaki."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_PRODUCE.BURNING"
