msgstr "Ha, ha! Zdechły nietoperz."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC"
