msgstr "Witaj, drzewne nasionko."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.PLANTED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.PLANTED"
