msgstr "Gleba jest taka nudna."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WILLOW.DESCRIBE.TURF_FOUNDATION"
