msgstr "Robi kawę, czy nie tak?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.COFFEEBUSH.BARREN"
