msgstr "Hmm... można by go przyciąć."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.HEDGE_BLOCK_ITEM"
