#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP.BURNING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PIG_SHOP_HATSHOP.BURNING"
