msgstr "Brzydactwo, nie?"

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.PINECONE.GENERIC"
