msgstr "Hej, koleś! Spokojnie."

#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODIE.DESCRIBE.POISONHOLE"
