#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.COOKPOT.COOKING_SHORT"
