#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.CORAL_BRAIN_ROCK"
