#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.GENERIC"
