#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DUNGBEETLE.SLEEPING"
