#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.DURIAN_COOKED"
msgid "Cookin' it up don't make it better."
