#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.ELEPHANTCACTUS_STUMP"
