#. STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING
msgctxt "STRINGS.CHARACTERS.WOODLEGS.DESCRIBE.PARROT_BLUE.SLEEPING"
